# GMS lowers the elemental resistance of everything the wizard attacks and
# hands them final damage besides. Both halves are here: GMS's `u = x+1` and
# `mdR = 4x+4` reach 10% and 40% at its nine levels, and this walks the same
# ceilings over the ten it masters at.
#
# The elemental half pays against a boss and nowhere else -- no ordinary
# monster resists anything. See kBossElementalBase.
name: "Elemental Decrease"
description:
  "Decreases the Elemental Resistance to all of your attacks. Also "
  "permanently increases Final Damage."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_MAGE skill_order: 5 }
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_FIRE_POISON_MAGE skill_order: 5 }
max_level: 10
base { final_dmg_pct: 0.04 ier_pct: 0.01 }
per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.04 ier_pct: 0.01 }
